'''Glucosamine Desert''' (グルコサミン砂漠 ''Gurukosamin Sabaku'', '''Glucosamine Desert''') is the 3rd sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Right between very easy and easy. Just like [[The Legend Begins]] and [[Passion Land]], this sub-chapter has some extremely easy levels. The only levels that may impose a challenge are [[Propolis Oasis]] ([[Celeboodle]]s and a [[Master A.]] are the main threats) and [[Hyaluronan Mountain]] ([[Dagshund]]'s introduction).
{{LegendDiff|150|200|300}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 2 new enemies:
*[[Celeboodle]]: A fast-moving, [[Single Attack]] enemy with low health but somewhat high attack power.
*[[Dagshund]]: A well-rounded unit in terms of stats. Has Area Attack, but is reasonably easy to stall because of its long attack animation.

